Differences in the relative abundance of the bacterial family composition between and within subjects were evaluated by calculating the JSD metrics38, which are generally used in enterotypes classification of the human gut microbiome57. The difference JSD (a, b) between samples a and b is defined as\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
